  "solution": "Given equation: 8 * 2 * 1 * 12 * 18 * 33.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷, −, −, +, = \n\nGiven: 8 * 2 * 1 * 12 * 18 * 33.\n\nAfter putting the sign we get:\n\n**8 ÷ 2** - 1 - 12 + 18 = 33.\n\n4 - 1** -**** 12 +**** 18** = 33.\n\n**4 -**** 1 + 6 **=33\n\n- 27 ≠ 33\n\nOption 2) ×, −, +, +, =\n\nGiven: 8 * 2 * 1 * 12 * 18 * 33.\n\nAfter putting the sign we get:\n\n__**8 × 2**__ - 1 + 12 + 18 = 33.\n\n__**16**__ - 1** __+ 12 +18 __**= 33.\n\n__**46 -1**__ = 33 \n\n47 ≠ 33.\n\n**Option 3) ÷, −, +, +, =**\n\nGiven: 8 * 2 * 1 * 12 * 18 * 33.\n\nAfter putting the sign we get:\n\n__**8 **____**÷ 2**__ - 1 + 12 + 18 = 33\n\n__**4**__ - 1 __**+ 12 + 18**__ = 33\n\n__**34 - 1**__ = 33\n\n**33 = 33.**\n\nOption 4) ÷, −, ×, +, =\n\nGiven: 8 * 2 * 1 * 12 * 18 * 33.\n\nAfter putting the sign we get:\n\n__**8 ÷ 2**__ - 1 × 12 + 18 = 33\n\n4 - __**1 **____**×**____** 12**__ + 18 = 33\n\n__**4**__ - 12__** +**____** 18**__ = 33\n\n__**22 - 12 **__= 33\n\n10 ≠ 33.\n\nHence, the correct answer is ***'Option 3'.***",
